 ## Background
-Cone tracing was introduced as an extension of sphere tracing for Signed Distance Field (SDF) rendering [S1, unofficial]. It was described in a thesis that discussed using cones to provide useful intersection information with minimal additional cost [S1, unofficial]. The technique has been implemented in various real-time rendering engines and demos to approximate indirect lighting and soft shadows in voxel-based environments [S2, unofficial][S3, unofficial].
-
